Allow opencode-pty to build against a vendored Ghostty source tree.

Upstream's build script requires GHOSTTY_SOURCE_DIR to be a Git checkout whose
HEAD matches ghostty-revision.  The port vendors Ghostty as a checksum-pinned
tarball, so skip the Git revision assertions when there is no repository to
compare against.

Honor OPENCODE_ZIG_CPU when invoking Zig, so the port's baseline CPU setting
actually applies to the vendored Ghostty build.

